msgctxt "L_IMP_004"
msgid "\n"
msgstr "\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_005"
msgid "Reactivate automatic defenses\n"
msgstr "Reactivar defensas automáticas\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_006"
msgid "Release hostages\n"
msgstr "Liberar a los rehenes\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_007"
msgid "Retrieve experimental weapon\n"
msgstr "Recuperar arma experimental\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_008"
msgid "Destroy sensitive information\n"
msgstr "Destruir información sensible\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_009"
msgid "Deactivate bomb\n"
msgstr "Desactivar bomba\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_010"
msgid "Obtain sensitive info.\n"
msgstr "Obtén información sensible.\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_011"
msgid "Guard's\n"
msgstr "Guarda:\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_012"
msgid "Sensitive info\n"
msgstr "Información sensible\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_013"
msgid "Sensitive info\n"
msgstr "Información sensible\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_014"
msgid "Picked up sensitive info.\n"
msgstr "Información sensible obtenida.\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_015"
msgid "Automatic gun activated.\n"
msgstr "Arma automática activada.\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_016"
msgid "Too many hostages killed.\n"
msgstr "Demasiados rehenes muertos.\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_017"
msgid "Hostages have been saved.\n"
msgstr "Los rehenes han sido salvados.\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_018"
msgid "Sensitive information has been destroyed.\n"
msgstr "La información sensible ha sido destruida.\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_019"
msgid "Carrington has been killed.\n"
msgstr "Carrington ha muerto.\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_020"
msgid "Joanna - we're under attack.\n"
msgstr "Joanna, nos atacan.\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_021"
msgid "Get the guns back on line - hurry.\n"
msgstr "Activa las armas, deprisa.\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_022"
msgid "The Skedar have taken hostages.\n"
msgstr "Los Skedar han tomado rehenes.\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_023"
msgid "Get up to the offices and save them.\n"
msgstr "Sube a las oficinas y sálvalos.\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_024"
msgid "They're using a new form of shield technology.\n"
msgstr "Están usando una nueva forma de tecnología de escudo.\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_025"
msgid ""
"Foster was working on a new weapon which may \n"
"be useful.\n"
msgstr ""
"Foster estaba trabajando en una nueva arma que \n"
"podría ser útil.\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_026"
msgid "Damn it. My office... If they get access...\n"
msgstr "Maldición. Mi oficina... Si logran acceder...\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_027"
msgid "Get there first, Jo, and destroy the files.\n"
msgstr "Ve allí primero, Joanna, y destruye los ficheros.\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_028"
msgid "Things are desperate. They've planted a bomb.\n"
msgstr "Las cosas van muy mal. Han puesto una bomba.\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_029"
msgid "Find it and get it out of the building.\n"
msgstr "Encuéntrala y sácala del edificio.\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_030"
msgid "Access denied - authorization failure.\n"
msgstr "Acceso denegado: autorización fallida.\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_031"
msgid "Emergency overrides have been engaged.\n"
msgstr "Las medidas de emergencia se han activado.\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_032"
msgid "Well done, Joanna. We're nearly clear...\n"
msgstr "Bien hecho, Joanna. Estamos casi a salvo...\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_033"
msgid "The last dropship is waiting for you. Hurry.\n"
msgstr "La última nave te está esperando. Deprisa.\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_034"
msgid "Critical mission object has been destroyed.\n"
msgstr "Objeto crítico de la misión destruido.\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_035"
msgid "The autodefenses will really help me out.\n"
msgstr "Las autodefensas me ayudarán de veras.\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_036"
msgid "So this is what Foster was working on.\n"
msgstr "Así que esto es en lo que Foster estaba trabajando.\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_037"
msgid ""
"I'll have to go carefully... The hostages are \n"
"counting on me.\n"
msgstr ""
"Debo de ir con cuidado... Los prisioneros \n"
"cuentan conmigo.\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_038"
msgid ""
"Well, at least I won't know if I'm doing \n"
"anything wrong.\n"
msgstr ""
"Bien, al menos no sabré si estoy \n"
"haciendo algo mal.\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_039"
msgid "The bomb has been detonated...\n"
msgstr "La bomba ha sido detonada...\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_040"
msgid "You have been given a Devastator.\n"
msgstr "Has obtenido un Devastador.\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_041"
msgid ""
"All ready, Joanna? We can't keep the Maian delegation waiting. Or the "
"President, of course.\n"
msgstr ""
"¿Preparada, Joanna? No podemos hacer esperar a la delegación Maian. Ni al "
"Presidente, por supuesto.\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_042"
msgid ""
"Am I ready? What do you mean? I was ready half an hour ago. It was you "
"holding us up!\n"
msgstr ""
"¿Preparada? ¿Qué quieres decir? Llevo preparada desde hace media hora. \n"
"¡Tú nos has entretenido!\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_043"
msgid ""
"But you know how it is, Joanna... I had to make sure my hair was just right,"
" and then there was the suit...\n"
msgstr ""
"Pero ya sabes cómo va, Joanna... Tengo que estar seguro de que mi pelo está "
"bien, y también estaba el traje...\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_044"
msgid "They should keep you away from mirrors. Nervous?\n"
msgstr "Deberían alejarte de los espejos. ¿Nervioso?\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_045"
msgid ""
"Very. I've waited for this moment for so many years. Contact, friendly "
"contact, between Humans and Maians is what the Institute was founded for. "
"And in a few minutes we'll be at the White House, and it will finally "
"happen...\n"
msgstr ""
"Mucho. Llevo esperando este momento desde hace bastantes años. El contacto, "
"amigable, entre Humanos y Maian es para lo que se fundó el Instituto. Y en "
"unos minutos estaremos en la Casa Blanca, y ocurrirá finalmente...\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_046"
msgid "Where did that come from?\n"
msgstr "¿De dónde proviene ese ruido?\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_047"
msgid "It was up on ground level...\n"
msgstr "Parece la planta baja...\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_048"
msgid ""
"Looks like someone doesn't know when to quit. We've got to get everyone "
"out!\n"
msgstr ""
"Parece que alguien no sabe cuándo retirarse. ¡Tenemos que sacar a todo el "
"mundo fuera!\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_049"
msgid "Get clear! I'll hold them off... You can come back and get me later!\n"
msgstr "¡Largo! Les mantendré alejados... ¡Puedes volver y recogerme luego!\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_050"
msgid "At least, I hope you can.\n"
msgstr "Al menos, espero que puedas.\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_051"
msgid "You need the Data Uplink.\n"
msgstr "Necesitas el Conector de Datos.\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_052"
msgid "Connection has been made.\n"
msgstr "Se ha realizado la conexión.\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_053"
msgid "Bypassing security systems.\n"
msgstr "Saltando sistemas de seguridad.\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_054"
msgid "Virus has been downloaded successfully.\n"
msgstr "El virus ha sido descargado con éxito.\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_055"
msgid "Ship's engines have been activated.\n"
msgstr "Los motores de la nave han sido activados.\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_056"
msgid "Connection to ship has been broken.\n"
msgstr "La conexión con la nave se ha cortado.\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_057"
msgid "Obtain Data Uplink.\n"
msgstr "Obtén el Conector de Datos.\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_058"
msgid "\n"
msgstr "\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_059"
msgid "Data Uplink\n"
msgstr "C. Datos\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_060"
msgid "A Data Uplink\n"
msgstr "Un Conector de Datos\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_061"
msgid "Picked up a Data Uplink.\n"
msgstr "Conector de Datos obtenido.\n"
